{"data": [{"author_id": "1329659857020932096", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:39:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115951584089694271"], "id": "2115951584089694271", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115815669581455750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Neuralink 又一个里程碑：2024 年确诊渐冻症（ALS）的 Terry，现在靠“想”就能重新说话。\n\n植入物把脑信号翻译成文字，再用 Grok Voice 还原他自己原本的声音。\n\n这段影片已经超过 22 万次浏览。脑机接口加上 AI 语音，正在从“能打字”走向“能用自己的声音说话”。 https://t.co/JHmmP27jME", "url": "https://x.com/SPCXBTC/status/2115951584089694271"}, {"author_id": "983052664320745472", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:44:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115952845161669006"], "id": "2115952845161669006", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1429, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115878430076207380", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🧠 Neuralink真正的突破，可能不只是让人重新说话！\n\n10月29日，Neuralink公布72小时技术开发成果：\n\n• 用意念唤醒Grok AI Agent，并执行任务。\n• 自动识别患者何时想说话。\n• 通过脑信号在iPhone上输入文字、拨打电话。\n\n我认为，最值得关注的是脑机接口与AI Agent的结合。 https://t.co/L6Qj4DmUWb", "url": "https://x.com/mylifeonmystyle/status/2115952845161669006"}, {"author_id": "3027431134", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:07:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115943650773348773", "2115946245462057148"], "id": "2115943650773348773", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 556, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115918769117905085", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Considering what the company (i.e., Sabi-BCI) does, this is a truly mind-blowing idea! https://t.co/RnPIXNbJDL", "url": "https://x.com/IntuitMachine/status/2115943650773348773"}, {"author_id": "2006566570089394177", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:22:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115917196413075664"], "id": "2115917196413075664", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Bishop’s principal Sébastien Lebel-Grenier has been named BCI board president. He spoke with The Pulse about university funding, international recruitment and what the role means locally.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/kbRhZTUvxr", "url": "https://x.com/pulsetownships/status/2115917196413075664"}, {"author_id": "2546757852", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:04:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115912721724014766"], "id": "2115912721724014766", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 15370, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🎮 La Switch 2 + EA SPORTS FC 27 está a $579.990 pagando con Lider BCI en Lider.\n\n🔗 https://t.co/QuzRyTmytq https://t.co/gnLRLqTeM2", "url": "https://x.com/DescuentosRata/status/2115912721724014766"}, {"author_id": "3448284313", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:47:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115923475126800699"], "id": "2115923475126800699", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 72, "impression_count": 10047, "like_count": 86, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115918744308658325", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Just insane research direction. It's like preference data straight from the brain. \n\nThey introduce RL with Neural Feedback (RLNF). It trains AI models on preferences decoded from brain signals.\n\nI did BCI research back in the day, so this feels like the kind of research https://t.co/UKxg8pRhBC https://t.co/PWmuTuJckk", "url": "https://x.com/omarsar0/status/2115923475126800699"}, {"author_id": "1863510095914512384", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:56:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115940749250281528"], "id": "2115940749250281528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Train on eight brains, test on a ninth: 37.6% vs 60.6% at home, 25% chance. Calibration lifts it only to 40.9% — no rung reaches usable. Brains aren't interchangeable. The honest work now is adaptation. #BCI #BuildInPublic", "url": "https://x.com/abstergo_media/status/2115940749250281528"}, {"author_id": "1219673761886167040", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:41:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115921912870387861"], "id": "2115921912870387861", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115853024534970698", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "IDC graphs are the only way the meta ripples will work for DePIN BCI s https://t.co/01MnkDnTr0", "url": "https://x.com/JoshuaJett/status/2115921912870387861"}, {"author_id": "1371589877758763009", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:39:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115951737857294467"], "id": "2115951737857294467", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 2731, "like_count": 51, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Butterfly Network says it’s added 3 BCI partners for its ultrasound-on-chip. \n\nMerge Labs, Bridge Neurotech and the third one is unnamed (any guesses anyone?)\n\nChips for brain interfaces are now becoming a real business", "url": "https://x.com/VelcoDar/status/2115951737857294467"}, {"author_id": "97700380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:46:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115923185241899197"], "id": "2115923185241899197", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1183, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115918744308658325", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "reinforcement learning with neural feedback. BCI is the future, and it's already here. https://t.co/NsSgOH9yEZ", "url": "https://x.com/andrewarruda/status/2115923185241899197"}, {"author_id": "