ught: \n\njust think “Hey Neuralink” plus a task!\n\nBuilt in a 72-hour hackathon, alongside auto speech detection and BCI speech piped straight into iPhone calls via @neuralink\n\nhttps://t.co/khARFZQkal https://t.co/GtWku6LZWu", "url": "https://x.com/FutureThrustHQ/status/2115914213390786849"}, {"author_id": "1487706600660172801", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:28:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115918725941694923"], "id": "2115918725941694923", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115715236720419034", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "ブレイン・コンピューター・インターフェース(#BCI) 長年にわたり、世界中の人々がマイクロ波攻撃を訴えてきた。中には特定の感覚パターンや知覚を刺激するほど集中的なものもある。被害者は世界中に存在しており延600万人と推定。 https://t.co/C3Owd7g5ol", "url": "https://x.com/CREOw4WxBTVzfaM/status/2115918725941694923"}, {"author_id": "1649231533306200064", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:41:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115936545240748301", "2115937120691081723"], "id": "2115937120691081723", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 34, "impression_count": 6428, "like_count": 47, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115918744308658325", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is a terrible direction from Sabi. We tried this exact approach at Egra and walked away from it because it’s wildly impractical.\n\nYou need a person wearing the hardware and continuous access to their brain signals just to train a personal preference model. That’s slower, https://t.co/57rTVyOONL", "url": "https://x.com/brianpdaley/status/2115937120691081723"}, {"author_id": "2023787217211322378", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:23:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115917352923455507"], "id": "2115917352923455507", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#TikTok https://t.co/ybT43pc3FR\n\nThis is a genuine medical development, with some important qualifications.\n\nChina announced approval of Neuracle’s NEO system on 13 March 2026 for a defined group of adults with tetraplegia caused by cervical spinal cord injury. The system decodes", "url": "https://x.com/RealityFilter73/status/2115917352923455507"}, {"author_id": "327231849", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:08:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115928851415233005"], "id": "2115928851415233005", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 615, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "恵州億緯鋰能（EVE Energy）が医療機器向け全固体電池と電動二輪車向けナトリウムイオン電池を公開\n\nEVE", "url": "https://x.com/myokoi1962/status/2115928851415233005"}, {"author_id": "1649231533306200064", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:39:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115936545240748301", "2115937120691081723"], "id": "2115936545240748301", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115918744308658325", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is a terrible direction from Sabi. We tried this exact approach at Egra and walked away from it because it’s wildly impractical.\n\nYou need a person wearing the hardware and continuous access to their brain signals just to train a personal preference model. That’s slower, https://t.co/57rTVyOgYd", "url": "https://x.com/brianpdaley/status/2115936545240748301"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1329659857020932096", "name": "Mickey 米奇 | Data First", "username": "SPCXBTC"}, {"id": "983052664320745472", "name": "Shawn", "username": "mylifeonmystyle"}, {"id": "3027431134", "name": "Carlos E. Perez", "username": "IntuitMachine"}, {"id": "2006566570089394177", "name": "The Pulse of the Eastern Townships", "username": "pulsetownships"}, {"id": "2546757852", "name": "Descuentos Rata 🐭", "username": "DescuentosRata"}, {"id": "3448284313", "name": "elvis"